            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="about-box">

            <div class="tag">WHY SAHRA?</div>

            <h2>More than tea.</h2>

            <p>
                Come for the tea. Stay for the atmosphere.
                Whether you're meeting friends, relaxing after school,
