                from the ordinary.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<section class="contact" id="contact">

    <div class="tag">VISIT US</div>

    <h2>Your next cup awaits.</h2>

    <p>
        Step into a different kind of tea experience.
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="tel:+2348000000000">
        Call Us
    </a>

    <div class="info">
        📍 Abuja, Nigeria<br>
        📞 +234 800 000 0000<br>
        ✉️ hello@sahratea.com
    </div>

</section>


<footer>
    © 2026 Sahra Tea House. Demo website created for portfolio purposes.
</footer>

</body>
</html>